claim.claim-text:
A kinetic- and directed-energy-harvesting exoskeleton armor system (2400), comprising:
      (a) an outer strike face comprising a dielectric Bragg mirror (2402) disposed over Boron Carbide ceramic tiles (2404);
      (b) a thermal-to-electric conversion stratum (2406) comprising 4H-SiC thermophotovoltaic cells and Bi2Te3 thermoelectric generators thermally and optically coupled to an inner surface of the ceramic tiles (2404);
      (c) an open-cell viscoelastic memory-foam kinetic absorption layer (2408) having a restitution coefficient e <= 0.035 and an embedded piezoelectric PVDF-TrFE lattice (2410) positioned behind the conversion stratum (2406);
      (d) a Ti-6Al-4V micro-channel cooling liner (2412) thermally coupled to a wearable closed-loop Cool Power Core (2414) operating a 90 deg C CVD-graphene cavitation chamber (2416) and a 33.6 kV ZVS plasma exciter (2418); and
      (e) a graphene-CNT supercapacitor bank (2420) storing electrical energy harvested from ballistic piezoelectric compression, viscoelastic dissipative heating, and directed-energy thermophotovoltaic conversion.
